<title>LUXEMBOURG: Finnish ERM move not coordinated - Niinisto.</title>
<headline>Finnish ERM move not coordinated - Niinisto.</headline>
<dateline>LUXEMBOURG 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish Finance Minister Sauli Niinisto said on Monday that Finland had had no contacts with other EU countries about joining the EU's exchange rate mechanism (ERM) at the same time.</p>
<p>There had been speculation that Italy had contacted Finland to coordinate a joint entry into the ERM.</p>
<p>But Niinisto said the timing of Finland's move was not linked to &quot;any ideas outside Finland&quot;.</p>
<p>&quot;We had no such contacts with any other member country about joining together,&quot; he told a news conference on the sidelines of a meeting of EU finance ministers.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
</text>
